  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting local feed self-sufficiency for inland aquaculture in Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enhance the production of high quality and cost-effective aquafeed by the small-scale feed manufacturing sector in Indonesia such that inland aquaculture famers can significantly improve their production performance with improved access to cost-effective quality feed and improved feeding management practices</narrative>
